### Current Version 1 Energy Allocation Policy

1. Supply facility load.
2. Maintain a 30% BESS reserve.
3. Charge the EV when sufficient excess solar power exists.
4. Continue charging the BESS toward 100%.
5. Export any remaining energy to the grid (future module).

### Design Philosophy

> **Every watt has a destination.**

The controller accounts for all available energy by allocating power according to system priorities rather than using fixed charging thresholds.
